
Quota OS microkernel
Version: 016 (11b8eb6)
基于三级资源声明的微内核，
保证一级任务永远不卡顿、二级任务运行不卡顿，三级任务则不保证。
[boot] EL1h, MMU off. No hardware isolation.
[boot] x0=0x44000000 physical RAM span 128 MB (probed)
[boot] DTB at 0x44000000
[boot] DTB snapshot 7512 bytes (header said 1048576)
[boot] DTB memory 134217728 bytes
[boot] system reserve 350 us/period, 16384 KB;
       tier-1 1500 us/period, 13312 KB; guard 80 us/period
[boot] EL1 identity map, when on, is not separate-process isolation. Three-tier hardware isolation is not claimed.
[boot] cache colors: 32 (model: 2 MB 16-way cache, 4 KB pages);
       tier-1 pages in 7 own colors, padding 11776 KB
[boot] kernel image+bss 1649 KB of the 16384 KB system reserve
[boot] GICv2 from DTB: distributor 0x8000000, cpu interface 0x8010000
[boot] CNTFRQ 62500000 Hz (1 tick = 16 ns), virtual timer PPI 27
[boot] clock: host time (not icount; timings are reference only)
[boot] simulated device IRQ line: EL1 physical timer, PPI 30
[boot] tier-1 display-vsync and timer-server bound to their slots
[boot] slot table from tick 34375000, period 625000 ticks, guard 1250 ticks
[boot] shell task running
[dev] 3 new simulated devices start in Tier 3; verifying
      (8 jobs, 8 aborts each, IRQs masked, before the next guard)
[dev] sim-dma: job 396/400 us, stop 15/20 us (measured/declared)
      [非 icount，仅供参考]
[dev] sim-blk: job 1991/2000 us, stop 1770/2000 us (measured/declared)
      [非 icount，仅供参考]
[dev] sim-cam: job 291/300 us, stop 7/30 us (measured/declared)
      [非 icount，仅供参考]
[boot] no bootarg, starting LVGL
[lvgl] autostart on the Tier-3 shell task
[lvgl] this task does not mask IRQs and it is not a tier-1 slot.
[lvgl] one kernel address space. Three-tier hardware isolation is not claimed.
[admit] lvgl heap 256 KB draw 120 KB framebuffer 1200 KB, fixed, pool expand 0
[admit] oversubscription probe 1
REFUSED: device does not meet minimum requirements
  minimum memory 4294967295 KB > 89600 KB for apps
  (RAM 131072 KB - system reserve - tier-1 - color padding)
No app can be closed to make room: this device is too small.
[admit] lvgl-demo accepted 1576 KB. cpu_min is 0. The shell stays tier 3.
[fb] reserved 1228800 bytes at 0x40ed4000 inside the system reserve
[fb] ramfb published 640x480 stride 2560 at 0x40ed4000 from fw_cfg 0x9020000
[input] virtio-mmio nodes 32 queue cap 32
[input] pointer "QEMU Virtio Tablet" base 0xa003c00 queue 8 abs 1 range x 0..32767 y 0..32767
[input] keyboard "QEMU Virtio Keyboard" base 0xa003e00 queue 8 abs 0 range x 0..0 y 0..0
[lvgl] upstream 9.3.0 heap 262144 draw 122880
[lvgl] white background, dark text
[lvgl] software cursor 16x16 black fill white outline hotspot 0,0
[lvgl] stress5 box 10,160 590x32
[lvgl] button box 8,300 120x36
